  "body": "Reported by @tzik in https://github.com/w3c/html/issues/62\n\n> The content model of <time> with a datetime attribute should be \"phrasing content\" and one without datetime attribute should be \"Text\" according to the following statement: \"A time element that does not have a datetime content attribute must not have any element descendants.\"\n",
